{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Dan, yadin his people.</b> Because he always marched behind the banners in the days of Moses and also in the days of Joshua, as it is written: ״והמאסף הולך אחר הארון״ — and he needed to do battle with all who pursued them, since they were mighty men, therefore he said <b>Dan, yadin his people</b>, meaning: he will avenge the vengeance of his people, like one of the tribes of Israel — as in ״כי ידין HaShem עמו״."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:13.586516009Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}